Subject: Allow introspection with the configured target executable launcher

OpenWrt's scanner uses an isolated target loader, so cross builds can
generate the runtime metadata required by GNOME Shell's JavaScript modules.

--- a/meson.build
+++ b/meson.build
@@ -54,1 +54,1 @@
-build_gir = get_option('introspection') and g_ir_scanner.found() and not meson.is_cross_build()
+build_gir = get_option('introspection') and g_ir_scanner.found()
